  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:03.460" end="00:04.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let's go)</p>

      <p begin="00:04.260" end="00:10.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let's go)</p>

      <p begin="00:10.560" end="00:15.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Come on, come on, come on)</p>

      <p begin="00:15.220" end="00:16.720" ttm:agent="v1">Yep</p>

      <p begin="00:16.090" end="00:17.730" ttm:agent="v1">I'm sixteen and I made a million</p>

      <p begin="00:17.730" end="00:19.550" ttm:agent="v1">If you cannot talk about money, then listen</p>

      <p begin="00:19.550" end="00:21.240" ttm:agent="v1">I was counting my racks in the kitchen</p>

      <p begin="00:21.240" end="00:23.280" ttm:agent="v1">Got VETEMENTS over my body and Christians</p>

      <p begin="00:23.280" end="00:24.780" ttm:agent="v1">Call my bros, they be on 'bout some mission</p>

      <p begin="00:24.730" end="00:26.920" ttm:agent="v1">If I made a plan then you better just stick to it</p>

      <p begin="00:26.920" end="00:28.640" ttm:agent="v1">You say you my girl, but you dancing on laps</p>

      <p begin="00:28.640" end="00:30.140" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, is your motherfuckin' rent due? (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:30.100" end="00:32.280" ttm:agent="v1">I made a mil' and these bitches, they just like to mimic</p>

      <p begin="00:32.280" end="00:33.870" ttm:agent="v1">Got chrome like I came out the matrix</p>

      <p begin="00:33.870" end="00:36.030" ttm:agent="v1">I'm moving around like I'm getting &quot;Fosho, fosho&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:36.030" end="00:37.530" ttm:agent="v1">She told me, &quot;Hako, you famous&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:37.430" end="00:38.930" ttm:agent="v1">I'm moving 'round town, I be going up</p>

      <p begin="00:38.630" end="00:40.810" ttm:agent="v1">Show for show, I thought I told you I'd make it?</p>

      <p begin="00:40.810" end="00:42.490" ttm:agent="v1">I fucked that bitch in the back of the Bimmer</p>

      <p begin="00:42.490" end="00:44.410" ttm:agent="v1">Lil bitch, she mad 'cause she knows I get riches (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:44.410" end="00:47.930" ttm:agent="v1">Move, and step, got hunnid bands by my side (Hunnid bands by my side)</p>

      <p begin="00:47.930" end="00:51.670" ttm:agent="v1">Move, go back, two's is all I ride (Two's is all I ride)</p>

      <p begin="00:51.670" end="00:55.050" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck then dip, got hunnid rounds by my side</p>

      <p begin="00:55.050" end="00:58.920" ttm:agent="v1">Black or white, like Oreo's, oh my God</p>

      <p begin="00:58.920" end="01:00.520" ttm:agent="v1">I'm sixteen and I made a million</p>

      <p begin="01:00.520" end="01:02.680" ttm:agent="v1">If you cannot talk about money, then listen</p>

      <p begin="01:02.680" end="01:04.390" ttm:agent="v1">I was counting my racks in the kitchen</p>

      <p begin="01:04.390" end="01:06.200" ttm:agent="v1">Got VETEMENTS over my body and Christians</p>

      <p begin="01:06.200" end="01:07.830" ttm:agent="v1">Call my bros, they be on 'bout some mission</p>

      <p begin="01:07.830" end="01:09.760" ttm:agent="v1">If I made a plan then you better just stick to it</p>

      <p begin="01:09.760" end="01:11.760" ttm:agent="v1">You say you my girl but you dancing on laps</p>

      <p begin="01:11.760" end="01:13.300" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, is your motherfuckin' rent due?</p>

